  desc: Moves the playhead and seeks the preview. View state, not an edit: nothing is undoable and the project is untouched. split, freeze_frame and add_marker default to this time.
== set_range
  desc: Sets the in/out range — Mark ▸ Set In (I) and Set Out (O). View state, not an edit: nothing is undoable and the project is untouched. Call it with NO bounds to clear the range (⌥X). export {range: "in_out"} writes only this span; get_project reports it as in_out_range.
